ower: SE per cell reported\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- auto_related_family: FAM:SF-APPA-050\n- observed_verdict: inconclusive\n- observed_failure_type: E_unclear\n- observed_notes: NOT_RECORDED\n- auto_confidence: medium (0.65)"}, {"id": "FAM:SF35", "score": 0.083, "document": "# FAM:SF35 | Study family SF35: Next-game playing-time response to opponent 3P luck (carryover)\n- observed_research_question: Next-game playing-time response to opponent 3P luck (carryover)\n- auto_outcome_status: artifact\n- observed_hypothesis: Game-N opponent 3P luck while on court changes a player's game N+1 share and starting status.\n- observed_result: [CHT-070] Opp 3P luck next-game share +0.063 (0.018); holding Game N role +0.002 (0.018). Start prob +0.0004 (0.0003) n.s. 1 SD (6.0 points) ~11 seconds. Own FG luck carry-over +0.113 (0.023) survives. Verdict KILL for t [cut; read_family for the full text]\n- observed_result: [TMP-011] G_opp3 +0.0625 (0.0180), shuffle null -0.0002 sd 0.0159 p 0.000; starting +0.00041 (0.00027) perm p 0.150/0.630; controlling game-N share G_opp3 +0.0020 (0.0178); adding expected opp 3P pts +0.0284 (0.0179); bi [cut; read_family for the full text]\n- auto_failure_mechanism: C_artifact (apparent effect produced by a construction, selection or labelling flaw)\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:insufficient_exposure"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-PAP-068", "score": 0.082, "document": "# FAM:SF-PAP-068 | Study family SF-PAP-068: Opponent three-point luck has no persistent player component\n- observed_research_question: Opponent three-point luck has no persistent player component\n- auto_outcome_status: supported\n- observed_hypothesis: Opponent three-point luck is noise: split-half reliability ~0 and H1 does not predict H2.\n- observed_result: odd/even reliability: opp 3s 0.004; opp 2s 0.463; XNET 0.585; own luck 0.477; teammate luck 0.427; PM 0.549; H1 opp3 -> H2 opp3 per 100: +0.008 (SE 0.009); H1 opp2 -> H2: +0.009 (SE 0.009)\n- auto_failure_mechanism: D_positive (no failure: positive result)\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:low_measurement_reliability\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:small_sample\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:MEASURE_RELIABILITY\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:SAMPLE_SIZE_POWER\n- observed_failure_evidence: reliability 0.004; H1->H2 +0.008 SE 0.009\n- observed_sample_and_power: 1,405 player-seasons; N=84,641 player-games\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- auto_related_family: FAM:SF36\n- observed_verdict: supported"}], "n_results": 4}

